s_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Datetime with **time zone** fail to be converted at insertion.\r\n\r\nRegression introduced in 1.4.10 for MSSQL with pyodbc dialect (works in sqlite). It works perfectly fine in 1.4.9.\r\n\r\n\r\n**Expected behavior**\r\nUTC should be converted properly\r\n\r\n**To Reproduce**\r\n```py\r\nclass Project(Base):\r\n    \"\"\"\r\n    Simple table describing projects.\r\n    \"\"\"\r\n\r\n    __tablename__ = \"project\"\r\n\r\n    id = Column(\"project_id\", Integer, primary_key=True)\r\n    name = Column(String, nullable=False)\r\n    description = Column(String, nullable=False)\r\n    created = Column(DateTime, nullable=False)\r\n    modified = Column(DateTime, nullable=False)\r\n\r\nsession.add(Project(name=\"name\", description=\"desc\", created=datetime.now(tz=pytz.timezone(\"utc\")), modified=datetime.now(tz=pytz.timezone(\"utc\"))))\r\nsession.commit()\r\n```\r\n\r\n**Error**\r\n\r\n```\r\n**{PendingRollbackError}This Session's transaction has been rolled back due to a previous exception during flush. To begin a new transaction with this Session, first issue Session.rollback(). Original exception was: (pyodbc.DataError) ('22007', '[22007] [Microsoft][ODBC Driver 17 for SQL Server][SQL Server]Conversion failed when converting date and/or time from character string. (241) (SQLExecDirectW)')\r\n[SQL: INSERT INTO project (name, description, created, modified, expired, progress, error, status) OUTPUT inserted.project_id VALUES (?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?)]\r\n[parameters: ('name', 'desc', '2021-04-26 21:35:09.051839 +00:00', '2021-04-26 21:35:09.051861 +00:00', None, None, None, None)]\r\n(Background on this error at: http://sqlalche.me/e/14/9h9h) (Background on this error at: http://sqlalche.me/e/14/7s2a)**\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis works perfectly fine:\r\n```py\r\n\r\nsession.add(Project(name=\"name\", description=\"desc\", created=datetime.now(), modified=datetime.now()))\r\nsession.commit()\r\n\r\n```\r\n\r\n**Versions.**\r\n - OS:\r\n - Python:b 3.8\r\n - SQLAlchemy: >=1.4.10\r\n - Database: MSSQL\r\n - DBAPI: pyodbc\r\n\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"sqlalchemy-bot","id":36047385,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MDQ3Mzg1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36047385?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot","html_url":"https://github.com/sqlalchemy-bot","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/6366/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/6366/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}